            "review_title": "Review at Nhà Hàng Nướng Toshiro BBQ",
            "review_text": "Jane L\n13 contributions\n0\nHidden gem Japanese BBQ in District 7\nOct 2024 • Friends\nToday my friend bring me to new opening Japanese BBQ restaurant in district 7, was thought just normal local restaurant however I was surprised that the taste is exactly the same taste I used to try in Japan.\nWow, the beef tongue is so amazing, soft and fresh! The scallops are so huge, with cheese more tasty! Must try! This restaurant is hidden jem in this area.\nDefinitely I will come back again.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nBest BBQ Japanese in Ho Chi Minh City. I tried a lot of other restaurants but the best place is this restaurant\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 14, 2024",
